(9, 3, 'en', 'Civil Engineering', 'Civil Engineering', 'The Department of Civil Engineering provides comprehensive training in structural mechanics, soil mechanics, concrete technologies, and project management. We prepare graduates to lead civil engineering infrastructure developments, high-rise buildings, and underground structures. Our research specializes in seismic-resistant structural engineering, concrete longevity, and geotechnical behaviors of desert soils.', NULL, 'Civil Engineering Dept', 'The Department of Civil Engineering provides comprehensive training in structural mechanics, soil mechanics, concrete technologies, and project management. We prepare graduates to lead civil engineeri', '2026-07-16 00:25:35', '2026-07-16 00:25:35'),
