(20, 5, 'ar', 'الميكانيكا والرسومات الهندسية', 'الميكانيكا والرسومات الهندسية', 'The Department of Mechanics and Engineering Graphics teaches the fundamental science of engineering: statics, dynamics, kinematics, materials strength, and computer drafting. We serve as a core technical department for the entire university, offering foundational courses in drawing, CAD modeling, and mechanical assembly simulations to prepare students for core industrial design.', NULL, 'الميكانيكا والرسومات الهندسية Dept', 'The Department of Mechanics and Engineering Graphics teaches the fundamental science of engineering: statics, dynamics, kinematics, materials strength, and computer drafting. We serve as a core techni', '2026-07-16 00:25:35', '2026-07-16 00:25:35'),
(21, 6, 'en', 'Technological Machines and Equipment', 'Technological Machines and Equipment', 'The Department of Technological Machines and Equipment trains mechanical engineers specializing in the design, installation, and maintenance of machinery used in light industry, cotton processing, food manufacturing, and chemical plants. We focus on machinery thermodynamics, vibration analysis, automated maintenance schedules, and machine durability.', NULL, 'Technological Machines and Equipment Dept', 'The Department of Technological Machines and Equipment trains mechanical engineers specializing in the design, installation, and maintenance of machinery used in light industry, cotton processing, foo', '2026-07-16 00:25:35', '2026-07-16 00:25:35'),
