(25, 7, 'en', 'Textile Materials Science', 'Textile Materials Science', 'The Department of Textile Materials Science focuses on the structures, physics, and chemistry of natural and synthetic fibers, yarns, and fabrics. Given Bukhara\'s position in cotton growing and processing, our research aims to optimize cotton fiber processing, analyze fabric strength, develop ecological dyes, and study smart textile integrations.', NULL, 'Textile Materials Science Dept', 'The Department of Textile Materials Science focuses on the structures, physics, and chemistry of natural and synthetic fibers, yarns, and fabrics. Given Bukhara\'s position in cotton growing and proces', '2026-07-16 00:25:35', '2026-07-16 00:25:35'),
