(65, 17, 'en', 'Department of Land Use and State Cadastre', 'Land Use and State Cadastre', 'The Department of Land Use and State Cadastre trains specialists in land cadastre, geodesy, geoinformatics, cartography, remote sensing, ecology, and land monitoring. Academic staff actively integrate digital technologies such as GIS, digital photogrammetry, and 3D modeling.', NULL, 'Department of Land Use and State Cadastre Dept', 'The Department of Land Use and State Cadastre trains specialists in land cadastre, geodesy, geoinformatics, cartography, remote sensing, ecology, and land monitoring. Academic staff actively integrate', '2026-07-16 00:25:35', '2026-07-16 00:25:35'),
