(1, 1, 'en', 'Software Engineering', 'Focuses on advanced software engineering, algorithm design, software architecture, and full-stack development.', 'Secondary school diploma\nHigh scores in Mathematics and Physics exams\nIELTS 5.5 or equivalent recommended', 'Passport, High school certificate.', 'Algorithms & Data Structures\nSoftware Design Patterns\nObject-Oriented Design\nAgile Software Development\nCloud Systems & DevOps\nMobile Application Development', 'Software Architect\nFull Stack Developer\nMobile App Developer\nDevOps Engineer\nQA Engineer', 'Software Engineering Bachelor', 'The Software Engineering program at Bukhara State Technical University prepares students to design, develop, and maintain complex software systems. Students learn software design patterns, object-orie', '2026-07-16 00:25:36', '2026-07-16 00:25:36'),
